# Repurposing Bay: "Sacrifice another artifact" is part of the cost (CR 118.3), so attempting the ability while the Bay is the only
# artifact rolls back, followed by a positive control once Mox Jet is cast. Sacrificing Mox
# Jet (mana value 0) searches for a mana value 1 artifact; the library holds only Mind Stone (mana value 2) and an Ornithopter (0), so
# the search finds nothing (CR 701.23b) and nothing arrives: Mox Jet is simply sacrificed, and Bot1's battlefield gains nothing.

